From: =?UTF-8?q?St=C3=A9phane=20Graber?= <stgraber@stgraber.org>
Date: Wed, 4 Nov 2026 19:36:20 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] incusd/network: Check restricted.networks.zones on network
 zone keys
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

The zone keys of a network only checked that the zone exists, so a
restricted project could publish records into any project's zone.

This addresses GHSA-fg2p-r659-c4q8 (CVE pending)

Signed-off-by: Stéphane Graber <stgraber@stgraber.org>
(cherry picked from commit 77efd86ca7be87c4ed00441ecbf8fb0ec1bf3b86)
